# n4 — trigger (mirrors demos/11-noita/115-trigger.bqn)
# Row 0 the trigger bolt beside enemy row 3, row 1 a plain bolt beside enemy row 4, row 2 a bolt in open air, row 5 a bystander.
# dist is euclidean over the pos pairs; default damage 3 stamps the payload the rule mints.
n 6
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5
col sparkBolt bool 1 1 1 0 0 0
col trigger bool 1 0 0 0 0 0
col firebolt bool 0 0 0 0 0 0
col damage num 3 3 3 0 0 0
default damage 3
col hit bool 0 0 0 0 0 0
col enemy bool 0 0 0 1 1 0
col health num 0 0 0 25 25 0
col pos vec 40 5 | 60 4 | 20 30 | 40 6 | 61 5 | 0 0
col parent num -1 -1 -1 -1 -1 -1
fn dist {√+´×˜(𝕨⊑pos)-𝕩⊑pos}
ja 火花弾 sparkBolt
ja 起爆 trigger
ja 火炎弾 firebolt
ja 損傷 damage
ja 命中 hit
ja 敵 enemy
ja 体力 health
ja 位置 pos
ja 親 parent
